{"articleNo":"105655","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=105655&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"캠퍼스 특허전략 유니버시아드대회 공고","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.04.22","hit":"3117","attachments":[{"name":"2014년 CPU대회 공고.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=105655&attachNo=72178"},{"name":"CPU리플릿(앞).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=105655&attachNo=72179"},{"name":"CPU리플릿(뒤).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=105655&attachNo=72279"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #6699ff\" color=\"#ffffff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">특허전략유니버시아드대회</span></font><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" color=\"#5d5d5d\">는 수상자에게 많은 포상금과 대기업 취업의 기회가 주어지는 전국 최대규모의 특허대전&nbsp;입니다. 산학협력단(창의지식재산센터)에서는 대회일정에 맞게 맞춤식 교육을 지원하여 여러분들의 입상을 돕고자 변리사 및 지식재산권 분야 전문가를 통하여 사전교육과 멘토식 답안작성 지도교육을 제공 할 예정입니다. 특허 초보자도 두려워 마시고 많은 관심과 참여바랍니다.</font></span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">▣ </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">대회 목적 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">:</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">대학의 실용적인 특허교육 확대를 통해 기업이 필요로 하는 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">지</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">식</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">재산</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">인재를 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">양성하고</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">대학의 창의적 아이디어를 산업계에 공급</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">하기</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">위함</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -33.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33.5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -36.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 36.2pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; 